course: dictionary
lesson: 12787
title: Words for clever people
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: An egghead is a person who is very clever and loves study, reading and big ideas. It is an informal word, so you will hear it in everyday talk, in cartoons and on the TV quiz show «Eggheads», but you would not usually use it in a formal school report.
explain: «Ben knew every fact about dinosaurs, so his friends called him an egghead.» Here the word is friendly, because the friends admire how much Ben knows. Look at the clues: knew every fact tells you that egghead means clever.
explain: Sometimes the word is used to mock someone. «The eggheads argued about theories all day and never fixed the leaking roof.» The author is saying the people are too clever in their books and out of touch with real life. Always check the tone: is the sentence kind or unkind?
fact: An egghead is a very clever person who is interested in study and ideas.
fact: «Egghead» is informal, so it is best kept for chatty talk and stories, not formal writing.
fact: A friendly word with a similar meaning is «brainbox».
fact: «Egghead» can be a gentle tease, but it can also be an insult when it suggests someone is too clever to understand real life.
fact: Phrases you may meet include «a bunch of eggheads» and «egghead scientists».
exercise: «Ben knew every fact about dinosaurs, so his friends called him an egghead.» What does egghead mean here? | A person who cracks eggs for breakfast | *A very clever person | A sleepy person | A person who is always late
exercise: Which word is a friendly synonym for egghead? | Daydreamer | *Brainbox | Slowcoach | Couch potato
exercise: Why might someone use «egghead» in a mocking way? | Because the person is very tall | Because the person is always laughing | Because the person loves cooking eggs | *Because they think the person is too clever and out of touch with real life
test: Which sentence uses egghead as an insult? | «Dad is a clever egghead who loves books.» | *«The eggheads argued about theories all day and never fixed the leaking roof.» | «My brainbox sister solved the puzzle in one minute.»
test: What is an egghead? | A type of breakfast | *A very clever person who loves study and ideas | Someone who is always hungry | A chicken farmer
exam: Which word means the same as egghead in a friendly way? | Jester | *Brainbox | Dunce | Slowcoach
